# Downloaded release artifacts. `gh release download` drops these in the repo
# root; they are tens of megabytes and rebuilt every release, so they belong on
# a GitHub release, never in git. See store/README.md.
/app-release.aab
/app-release.apk
/bundle/
/flutter-apk/
*.ipa
